<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech March CPI +0.1 pct mo/mo (+0.3), +6.8 (+7.3).</title>
<headline>Czech March CPI +0.1 pct mo/mo (+0.3), +6.8 (+7.3).</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech consumer prices rose 0.1 percent in March putting prices 6.8 percent higher than in the same month of last year, the Statistical Bureau (CSU) said on Tuesday.</p>
